          "type": "prose",
          "text": "The same CloudFormation template can provision equivalent declarations in multiple approved environments. Each approved account/Region pair still needs its own verified deployment record. Use a named role profile with role_arn and source_profile; verify the caller with aws sts get-caller-identity --profile NAME. Create the supplied stack with that profile and explicit --region REGION.",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "lineage": {
